# Go testing

- Run: `cd api && go test ./...`
- Every bug fix in `internal/services` or `internal/calibration` gets a regression test before the fix
- Prefer table-driven tests for scoring, calibration, and aggregation
- Use `t.Helper()` in test helpers; no order-dependent suites
- Integration tests that need Postgres: document in `docs/project/setup.md` (local Docker dev DB)
